# Screenshots and files delivered into the folder by Claude — useful to look
# at, not part of the app.
Claude outputs/

# Source audio. Jay keeps the masters outside the project and copies them in
# only to run `npm run build:sounds`, so they should never end up in a commit —
# a 45-file set of WAVs is tens of MB, and git would keep every version of every
# one forever. The built .m4a files under public/sounds/ ARE committed, so the
# app stays reproducible from the repo alone.
sounds-src/*
!sounds-src/README.md
